 "fields": {
  "description": "The tree-sitter + SQLite code index (`crates/codeindex/`, 50 files / 16,056 lines; 5 languages). It walks a root, parses definitions/references/imports, resolves imports per language, ranks files PageRank-style, and serves both the `code_*` tools to the model and the Here/Fit/Change lenses to the CodeMap panel. The actor (`src/lib.rs` L127–L218) is a kameo plugin started by `CodeindexPlugin::start`; see the child diagram for module flow.",
  "context": null,
  "constraint": null,
  "concern": "`tools.rs` (2,070 lines) and `lens.rs` both re-implement row→text rendering over the same store queries; `locate.rs`, `profile.rs`, `root.rs` and `outline_hook.rs` are left out of the diagram (under 12 nodes) and are described only here: locate resolves board anchors, profile reads manifests for project_profile, root picks the git root, outline_hook feeds read_file outlines.",
  "todo": null,
  "note": null
 },
